  unitName: Light Idol
  unitId: 50122
  unitNumber: 187
  description: Worshipers of light gave this miraculous stone idol life through prayer.
    It's said that the holy power it holds can call forth mysterious powers sleeping
    in all life.Its discoverer was attracted to its divinity, got too close and then
    took a severe blow from it. It's called the "light-beard giant" since beams of
    light are seen emitting from its mouth.
  summonDesc: I am a Light Idol.<br>It seems you know my purpose. <br>I will go with
    you.
